title One request through the harness

user     "You"
inbox    "Inbox" queue
prompt   "Prompt sections"
history  "Derived history"
model    "Model adapter"
pipeline "Tool pipeline"
sandbox  "Sandbox"
child    "Helper agent"
screen   "Screen"
logged   "Events logged" counter 0

req at user

# One typed request will visit every part of the harness before it is answered.
pause "The request: the failing test in src/math.test.ts, fix it."

# The request waits in the inbox, then the idle agent wakes and claims it.
req -> inbox : queued "A followup starts a new turn because the agent is idle."
logged +1

# Each step rebuilds the system prompt and the history from the log.
req -> prompt : running "Sections sorted by order: identity first, then each tool's guidance."
req -> history "Messages are rebuilt from the event log, growing only at the end."

# The model streams a reply; the screen shows the pieces live.
req -> model "The adapter turns the provider's stream into chunks and assembles one message."
new piece at model
piece -> screen "Stream pieces are shown live but never logged."
remove piece
logged +1

# The tool call asks first, then runs inside the fence.
new call at model
call -> pipeline : waiting "Running a command is risky, so the person is asked first."
call : running
call -> sandbox "Only the project folder can be changed."
logged +2

# The result is logged and becomes part of the next request.
call -> history : done "Big output is spilled; old history may be summarized by compaction."
remove call

# A helper checks other tests; its answer comes back through the inbox.
new kid at model
kid -> child : running "The helper has its own log and stops at depth 1."
kid -> inbox : done "The answer arrives as a steer and wakes the parent's next step."
remove kid
logged +1

# Nothing is left to ask for, so the final answer reaches the screen.
req -> screen : done "The turn ends; every fact is in the log."
logged +1
